#: installer.cpp:127
msgid "Get New Themes..."
msgstr "Obtener temes nuevos..."

#: installer.cpp:128
msgid "Get new themes from the Internet"
msgstr "Obtener temes nuevos dende Internet"

#: installer.cpp:129
msgid ""
"You need to be connected to the Internet to use this action. A dialog will "
"display a list of themes from the http://www.kde.org website. Clicking the "
"Install button associated with a theme will install this theme locally."
msgstr ""
"Necesites tar coneutáu a Internet pa usar esta aición. Un diálogu va amosar "
"una llista de temes del sitiu web http://www.kde.org. Calcando nel botón "
"Instalar asociáu con un tema, instalaráse llocalmente."

#: installer.cpp:133
msgid "Install Theme File..."
msgstr "Instalar ficheru de tema..."

#: installer.cpp:134
msgid "Install a theme archive file you already have locally"
msgstr "Instalar un ficheru de tema llocal"

#: installer.cpp:135
msgid ""
"If you already have a theme archive locally, this button will unpack it and "
"make it available for KDE applications"
msgstr ""
"Si yá tienes un ficheru de tema en llocal, esti botón va descomprimilu y "
"facer que tea disponible a les aplicaciones de KDE"

#: installer.cpp:139
msgid "Remove Theme"
msgstr "Desaniciar tema"

#: installer.cpp:140
msgid "Remove the selected theme from your disk"
msgstr "Desaniciar el tema seleicionáu del so discu"

#: installer.cpp:141
msgid "This will remove the selected theme from your disk."
msgstr "Esto va desaniciar el tema seleicionáu del so discu"

#: installer.cpp:146
msgid "Test Theme"
msgstr "Probar tema"

#: installer.cpp:147
msgid "Test the selected theme"
msgstr "Probar el tema seleicionáu"

#: installer.cpp:148
msgid "This will test the selected theme."
msgstr "Esto probará'l tema seleicionáu"

